    "summary": "The bearer's unit may make a **normal move** in reply to an enemy unit ending its move within 8\" of it during your opponent's Movement phase, provided the bearer's unit is **unengaged**. This works no more than once each turn for each unit. Only an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER** model that is not a **TERMINATOR** may take it.\n\nThe move is up to:\n\n- D6\"\n- 6\" instead, if the bearer's unit has **Divination Discipline**",
